{"reviews":[{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-0","r":4.0,"t":"nice but needs alot of building up","x":"I ordered this and the figtastic palette and used then both for two days in a row now.Im trying to branch out and use different brands.. I like both the palettes but u do have to build up the colors a lot and some are aliitle chalky. I used a white base under my shadows which I always do. I like the palette, but don't expect Anastasia quality.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-1","r":5.0,"t":"This palette is a winner!","x":"One of the best palettes I ever used.  Great for everyday use,  all-matte, nice pigment and blends to perfection.  I had always wanted a purple eyeshadow palette like Morphe's, but I know I love this one.  You can get natural and smoky looks and the palette size makes it easy to carry around. Make sure you get this one before you try a larger palette.","h":6,"v":0,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-2","r":1.0,"t":"I don't recommend buying these make up","x":"I don't recommend buying these make up...the colors are not the same on the picture...and all the colors are the same they just get darker...I regret buying it..plus it not very pigmented I wanted a wine color and they are all purple...not cool..","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-3","r":1.0,"t":"False Advertisement","x":"If I could give NO stars I would!  The colors I received look absolutely nothing like the picture..false advertisement at its finest. DO NOT BUY unless you like faded chalky looking eyeshadow","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-4","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous basic color palette","x":"Great quality. Stays put. Saturated pigment.  I expect this will last me a long time.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-5","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Colors are not very pigmented. The purple shades barely showed up on me.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-6","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Colors are not very pigmented. The purple shades barely showed up on me.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-7","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Very good pigment for the price, nice colors if you like coffee","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-8","r":1.0,"t":"Faintly pigmented, dusty, and chalky.  Not recommended for women of color - or anyone else frankly.","x":"Not recommended for women of color. It is only lightly pigmented and chalky; the colors very pastel. It will hardly show up on your skin. The three colors on the lower right look nearly identical in the pan and all three look like faint dark streaks on skin. The 3 colors on the left side (lilac and 2 light browns) do not even show up on my palm. The purples in the middle of the top show do show faintly, but all of the shadows are dusty and brush off in a few swipes. I threw mine away.  I recomme","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-9","r":1.0,"t":"Very horrible eye shadow","x":"Very horrible eye shadow. I'm very disappointed with this product. When you put your blending or regular applyer brush to the pallet it starts all falling apart ive had to throw it away so my money has been wasted. The colors are horrible for fair skin even with really great blending skills nothing makes it look good it just looks like you have bruised eye lids.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-10","r":4.0,"t":"Good palette for the price","x":"Good palette for the price. You will get a good deal of fall out and you will need to use an eyeshadow primer if you want to see some real pigment. You can layer to build stronger color. Blends well(use brushes and throw away the sponge wand). The colors themselves are nice and if you're patient you can get really vivid color out of them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-11","r":3.0,"t":"Just meh","x":"This eyeshadow isn't terrible, but isn't awesome either. It's not very pigmented and is really powdery so there is a lot of fall off. It does the job if you use the browns, the purples I have had absolutely no luck with. If you wet the brush it works a bit better, but overall I'm not super impressed","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-12","r":1.0,"t":"No second chance","x":"I was so excited to try this eyeshadow pallet, but all the shades were shattered. Wish I had the chance to try it, but won\u2019t risk getting them again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-13","r":5.0,"t":"I love it I ordered Thursday and got it on Friday","x":"I love it I ordered Thursday and got it on Friday. Luckily it from Fort Lauderdale FL. So I didn't have to way long. It is pigment.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-14","r":5.0,"t":"Accentuates hazel eyes","x":"Very pretty. I love how the colors really accentuate my green hazel eyes. Stays on all day too.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality for the price!","x":"Came super fast and the colors are super pigmented.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-16","r":4.0,"t":"Nice Colors","x":"I like the color selection in this palette. I use MAC paint pot on my lid before applying the shadow and it stays on all day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-17","r":2.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Great but too much fall out. Cool for the price. On a second thought. It's useless. Not pigmented needs a lot of work.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-18","r":1.0,"t":"Super bummed!","x":"Received my package and several of the colors had shattered. So most of the colors are mixed up! Super bummed!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-19","r":4.0,"t":"Very nice","x":"Nice colours. And really matte. But u definitely have to use a primer for it to last long.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-20","r":5.0,"t":"great eyesahdows","x":"Great colors very pigmented, good quality eyesahdows, very good for the price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-21","r":2.0,"t":"Wouldn't buy again","x":"They swatch well but disappear on the eye. Not made for darker tones.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-22","r":2.0,"t":"Um..","x":"It's really bad, isn't as pigmented and it has a lot of fallout","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-23","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"I love the colors but they don't really blend well for me.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01CC0C3ZK-24","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Not the colors I wanted, four of them are too dark.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the eyeshadow poorly pigmented, with colors barely showing up on the skin.","cites":[3,6,7,9,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the shadows as chalky, powdery, or dusty, with fallout and needing to be built up.","cites":[1,4,9,11,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the colors received look nothing like the product pictures.","cites":[3,4]},{"text":"A number of reviewers praise the palette as good quality and good value for the price, with nice pigment and staying power.","cites":[2,5,8,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the palette arrived shattered or fell apart, wasting their money.","cites":[10,13]}]},"qa":[]}